<p>Open a gateway to the Fearscape, stepping through it to a nearby location. As you step out, a burst of fire will leave with you, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">140, 188, 226, 258, 286</acronym> demonfire damage to everyone within <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> spaces and leaving flames which will deal an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">140, 188, 226, 258, 286</acronym> demonfire damage over 4 turns.</p><p>Additionally, shifting through reality enhances your awareness, allowing you to see all enemies within <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8, 8, 9, 9, 10</acronym> spaces for the next 3 turns.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower and the range will increase with the talent level.</p>